"end":40,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"四嶽","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、官職或未定指代；不推造個別姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"四嶽","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、官職或未定指代；不推造個別姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"帝堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0147","start":147,"end":148,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0155","start":155,"end":156,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0157","start":157,"end":158,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0159","start":159,"end":160,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m002-0164","start":164,"end":165,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-002-xia","book_id":"b-shiji-002","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-002-xia"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:p005","text":"禹乃遂與益、后稷奉帝命，命諸侯百姓興人徒以傅土，行山表木，定高山大川。禹傷先人父鯀功之不成受誅，乃勞身焦思，居外十三年，過家門不敢入。薄衣食，致孝于鬼神。卑宮室，致費於溝淢。陸行乘車，水行乘船，泥行乘橇，山行乘檋。左準繩，右規矩，載四時，以開九州，通九道，陂九澤，度九山。令益予衆庶稻，可種卑溼。命后稷予衆庶難得之食。食少，調有餘相給，以均諸侯。禹乃行相地宜所有以貢，及山川之便利。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"益","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000051","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"益","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000051","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m005-0173","start":173,"end":174,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-002-xia","book_id":"b-shiji-002","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-002-xia"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p009","text":"箕子對曰：「在昔鯀陻鴻水，汨陳其五行，帝乃震怒，不從鴻範九等，常倫所斁。鯀則殛死，禹乃嗣興。天乃錫禹鴻範九等，常倫所序。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000151","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m009-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m009-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m009-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"鯀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000029","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m009-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m009-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-001","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi","source":{"title":"史記／卷001","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷001","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷001&oldid=7903634","revision_id":7903634,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文全文；不含現代章節標題、跨維基說明與校勘記","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫 CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及版本連結。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"弃":"棄","异":"異"},"note":"保留古代異體；移除現代註號，兩個簡體字形明記轉換。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-002-xia","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-002","source_id":"s-shiji-002-xia","source":{"title":"史記／卷002","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷002","permalin